### Big Art edition

As part of the installation at Big Art I showed a scale model of the large objects. With this model visitors could experience themselves the possibilities of the objects.

Especially for Big Art 2026 I've made an edition of four unique works. Each work consists of three objects and is made of the same six colors but arranged differently.

name series: Mod-Obj-3a, b, c, d\
size: 6 x 8,2 x 11,2 cm (per object)\
medium: acrylic on beech wood\
year: 2026\
price: € 650 (incl VAT, excl shipping costs)

